  << /ActualText (Data Center\054 Ecosystem \046 Marketplace \031 Apr 2023 \023 Sep 2025\nLed CX strategy for Ecosystem and Marketplace teams which drove company\055level cloud transformation goals affecting 10M\053 paid cloud seats\056 Reached an important milestone of 1000 apps built on the Forge platform within 3 years\056\240\nLed 4 pricing initiatives \050App Editions\054 Bundles\054 Multi\055Instance Licensing\054 Partner Release\051 for Atlassian Marketplace which led to 25\053 apps adopting advanced editions in the first 3 months\nTransformed content design operations achieving an hour saved per release note and 50\045 faster off\055cycle requests using AI\055assisted workflows\nDrove the Aether Project to modernize Atlassian Marketplace\054 boosting app conversions by 13\045\054 install clicks by 10\045\054 and homepage visits by 105\045\054 while improving accessibility\054 SEO\054 and platform scalability)
